    "text": "Trump’s Attempt to Fire Fed Governor Lisa Cook Fails | No Force, No Removal for Now | N18GIn a major legal and political development, **President Donald Trump’s bid to fire Federal Reserve Governor Lisa Cook has failed for now, as courts push back on his attempt to remove her from office. A federal appeals court earlier rejected Trump’s effort to oust Cook, and the U.S. Supreme Court has expressed skepticism about the president’s authority to unilaterally remove a Fed governor, underscoring the central bank’s independence in the process. #Trump #FederalReserve #lisacook News18 Mobile App - https://onelink.to/desc-youtube",
